Cell["\<\
Paths tagged with a \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]gating\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
option act as temporal gates with respect to the circuit\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
cycle counter. This circuit lets its input pass through in two out of three \
cycles:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"42dc765e-7fdb-4a9a-85ea-c1e1a67816bc"],

